# Business data — never commit
*.json
!package.json
# Test certificate reference data — process specs and per-issue records.
# Not transactional/financial data; consumed by the cert generator and (later)
# the SEP app cert-issue feature. Whitelisted explicitly.
!docs/test-certificates/cert-shop-data.json
!docs/test-certificates/cert-issues.json
# Claude Code session config — tooling, not business data. Without this
# exception the *.json rule above silently drops it and the SessionStart hook
# is never registered, leaving the script in the repo doing nothing.
!.claude/settings.json

# Backups
*-backup-*
*-export-*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
*.swp
*.swo
*~
!manifest.json
# Build stamp written by split/build.sh — an artefact, not data.
!version.json
# The Windows widget's Adaptive Card template — code, not data. Without this the
# *.json rule drops it, and sw.js lists it in the atomic install set, so a
# missing template would stop the service worker installing at all.
!widgets/todo-template.json
# P228's record of how paper prints (computed styles of the printed documents on the sweep's made-up book, no business
# data): the check that UI pass 3 never reaches paper.
!tests/fixtures/paper-looks.json
# The feeds Worker's lockfile: CI's npm ci and Cloudflare's build install from it,
# and without this exception the *.json rule above drops it and both refuse to install.
!server/feeds/package-lock.json
# The feeds Worker run locally (wrangler dev): its state, and the local variables
# file, which would hold the owner's contact.
.wrangler/
.dev.vars*

# Playwright e2e (arming directive 2026-04-24)
node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
.last-run.json
